    <briefdescription>
<para>Bitmasks for panel pixel formats in devicetree. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each <computeroutput>PANEL_PIXEL_FORMAT_*</computeroutput> value uses the same bit position as the matching <computeroutput>PIXEL_FORMAT_*</computeroutput> entry in <ref refid="group__display__interface_1gac346bc56771052a8fe919c3ec23d7c9c" kindref="member">display_pixel_format</ref>.</para>
<para>These macros exist because C enumerators cannot be used in devicetree source files.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__display__interface_1gac346bc56771052a8fe919c3ec23d7c9c" kindref="member">display_pixel_format</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
